# Patch: Add xLSTM sequence mixer as a drop-in attention alternative
#
# Problem:
#   Megatron-LM core_v0.16.1 ships Mamba and GDN as sequence mixing
#   alternatives to standard self-attention, but has no support for xLSTM
#   (Extended Long Short-Term Memory, Beck et al. 2024). There is no
#   mLSTM-based mixer, no layer spec, and no entrypoint for xLSTM training.
#
# What this patch does:
#   Adds four new files — no existing files are modified:
#
#   megatron/core/ssm/xlstm_mixer.py
#     Implements xLSTMMixer, a MegatronModule drop-in for SelfAttention.
#     Satisfies the TransformerLayer submodule contract:
#       - forward(hidden_states, ...) -> (output, bias=None)
#       - hidden_states shape [seq, batch, hidden] (sequence-first)
#     Internally: one fused input projection [q|k|v|i|f|o], depth-wise
#     causal conv1d on q/k/v (kernel size 4, same trick as Mamba), then
#     the mLSTM matrix-memory recurrence (C_t = f_t*C_{t-1} + i_t*v_t k_t^T),
#     per-head GroupNorm, output projection. Causal by gate construction —
#     ignores attention_mask and rotary_pos_emb entirely.
#
#   megatron/core/models/xlstm/xlstm_layer_specs.py
#     Provides xlstm_layer_spec(use_transformer_engine=True) returning a
#     ModuleSpec(module=TransformerLayer, submodules=TransformerLayerSubmodules(
#       self_attention=xLSTMMixer, ...)) with TE or local norm/linear backends.
#     Mirrors megatron/core/models/gpt/gpt_layer_specs.py; only self_attention
#     changes — input_layernorm, MLP, and both BDA residuals are unchanged.
#
#   megatron/core/models/xlstm/__init__.py
#     Package init exposing xlstm_layer_spec at megatron.core.models.xlstm.
#     Mirrors megatron/core/models/mamba/__init__.py.
#
#   pretrain_xlstm.py
#     Training entrypoint (sibling of pretrain_gpt.py). Monkey-patches
#     megatron.core.models.gpt.gpt_layer_specs.get_gpt_decoder_block_spec
#     to return an all-xLSTM TransformerBlockSubmodules, then delegates to
#     pretrain_gpt.py via runpy. No existing files modified.
#
# How to find the right location in a future version:
#   The mixer belongs alongside other SSM mixers in megatron/core/ssm/.
#   The spec belongs alongside other model specs in megatron/core/models/.
#   The entrypoint pattern (monkey-patch + runpy) is self-contained in
#   pretrain_xlstm.py and does not depend on any specific line numbers.
#
# Launching:
#   Use launch_xlstm.sh (lives in $WORKDIR, not in this submodule).
#   Key differences from launch.sh:
#     - torchrun target: pretrain_xlstm.py
#     - --position-embedding-type none  (xLSTM is position-free)
#     - --group-query-attention / --num-query-groups removed
#     - pip install xlstm  (replaces mamba-ssm causal-conv1d)
#     - MASTER_PORT=25680
#
# Applied to: Megatron-LM core_v0.16.1

